# #445: this directory is no longer where the capture sidecar is READ from — a
# gtest reading <cell>-capture.fix here always compared against the PREVIOUS
# run's frames, since the parent harness only writes it (write_inrepo_golden,
# phase-9-harness/tools/run_interop_cell.py) in `_finalize`, AFTER the gtest has
# already exited. The diff itself now runs in `_finalize`, against that same
# run's own capture, via `interop_golden_check` — the harness writes the
# capture into its own per-run directory and never places it here.
#
# This entry is kept only to ignore stale *-capture.fix files left over from
# before the fix (or from any local ad hoc run); only the committed reference
# golden (<cell>.fix) is tracked.
*-capture.fix
